---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Beasiswa & Biaya | Cosmo Education">
<main class="w-full pt-20 bg-surface min-h-[calc(100vh-80px)]"><div class="flex flex-col w-full">
<!-- Title & Strategic Insight Banner -->
<section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12 w-full pt-8 pb-12">
<div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-end justify-between gap-8 bg-surface-container-low rounded-xl p-8 lg:p-12 relative overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
<div class="absolute -right-20 -bottom-20 w-96 h-96 rounded-full bg-secondary-fixed/30 blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
<div class="absolute left-1/3 -top-24 w-80 h-80 rounded-full bg-primary-fixed/20 blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
<div class="max-w-3xl relative z-10">
<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-surface-container-high text-primary font-label-sm text-label-sm mb-4">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm text-secondary" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">stars</span>
<span>PANDUAN RESMI 2025/2026</span>
</div>
<h1 class="font-display-lg text-display-lg text-primary tracking-tight leading-tight">
          Pusat Informasi Beasiswa &amp; Perencanaan Biaya Studi Luar Negeri
        </h1>
<p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant mt-4">
          Akses panduan komprehensif pendanaan akademik, simulasi anggaran realistis lintas 6 negara utama, dan kurasi beasiswa prestisius dari pemerintah maupun universitas mitra Cosmo Education.
        </p>
</div>
<div class="shrink-0 flex flex-col sm:flex-row lg:flex-col gap-3 relative z-10 w-full sm:w-auto">
<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest px-6 py-4 rounded-xl shadow-sm flex items-center gap-4">
<div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-surface-container flex items-center justify-center text-primary">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-2xl">account_balance</span>
</div>
<div>
<div class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant">TOTAL DANA TERAMANKAN</div>
<div class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary font-bold">IDR 42.8 Miliar+</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest px-6 py-4 rounded-xl shadow-sm flex items-center gap-4">
<div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-surface-container flex items-center justify-center text-secondary">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-2xl">verified_user</span>
</div>
<div>
<div class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant">RASIO TEMBUS AWARDEE</div>
<div class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary font-bold">89.4% Calon Bimbingan</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- Interactive Financial & Scholarship Estimator -->
<section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12 w-full py-8">
<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl p-6 sm:p-10 shadow-md">
<div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-4 mb-8">
<div>
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-secondary font-bold">Simulator Keuangan &amp; Kelayakan</span>
<h2 class="font-headline-xl text-headline-xl text-primary font-bold mt-1">Kalkulator Estimasi Biaya &amp; Peluang Beasiswa</h2>
</div>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant max-w-md">
          Uji kecocokan profil akademik Anda secara real-time untuk melihat estimasi pengeluaran kotor dan proyeksi potongan beasiswa.
        </p>
</div>
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-start">
<!-- Input Form -->
<div class="lg:col-span-6 flex flex-col gap-5 bg-surface-container-low p-6 rounded-xl">
<div>
<label class="block font-label-md text-label-md text-primary mb-2" for="degree-select">Jenjang Studi Direncanakan</label>
<div class="relative">
<select class="w-full h-11 px-4 pr-10 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-lowest text-on-surface font-body-sm text-body-sm appearance-none focus:outline-none shadow-sm cursor-pointer" id="degree-select">
<option value="bachelor">Sarjana / Undergraduate (S1)</option>
<option selected="" value="master">Pascasarjana / Master (S2)</option>
<option value="doctorate">Doktoral / PhD (S3)</option>
<option value="pathway">Diploma / Pathway Foundation</option>
</select>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined absolute right-3 top-2.5 text-on-surface-variant pointer-events-none">expand_more</span>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<label class="block font-label-md text-label-md text-primary mb-2" for="country-select">Negara Pilihan Utama</label>
<div class="relative">
<select class="w-full h-11 px-4 pr-10 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-lowest text-on-surface font-body-sm text-body-sm appearance-none focus:outline-none shadow-sm cursor-pointer" id="country-select">
<option selected="" value="uk">Inggris Raya (United Kingdom)</option>
<option value="aus">Australia</option>
<option value="usa">Amerika Serikat (USA)</option>
<option value="ger">Jerman (Germany)</option>
<option value="can">Kanada (Canada)</option>
<option value="jpn">Jepang (Japan)</option>
</select>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined absolute right-3 top-2.5 text-on-surface-variant pointer-none">expand_more</span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
<div>
<div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-2">
<label class="font-label-md text-label-md text-primary" for="gpa-range">IPK / Rata-rata Rapor</label>
<span class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-secondary font-bold" id="gpa-display">3.75</span>
</div>
<input class="w-full accent-primary h-2 bg-surface-container-highest rounded-lg cursor-pointer" id="gpa-range" max="4.00" min="2.80" step="0.05" type="range" value="3.75"/>
<div class="flex justify-between text-[11px] text-on-surface-variant mt-1 font-mono">
<span>2.80</span>
<span>3.50</span>
<span>4.00</span>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-2">
<label class="font-label-md text-label-md text-primary" for="english-range">Skor IELTS Equivalent</label>
<span class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-secondary font-bold" id="english-display">7.0</span>
</div>
<input class="w-full accent-primary h-2 bg-surface-container-highest rounded-lg cursor-pointer" id="english-range" max="8.5" min="5.5" step="0.5" type="range" value="7.0"/>
<div class="flex justify-between text-[11px] text-on-surface-variant mt-1 font-mono">
<span>5.5</span>
<span>6.5</span>
<span>8.5</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="p-4 rounded-lg bg-surface-container flex items-start gap-3 mt-1">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary mt-0.5">info</span>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">
              Parameter ini mengkalkulasi skema tuition fee rata-rata universitas mitra tingkat Tier 1 &amp; Tier 2 serta baseline tunjangan hidup resmi kementerian imigrasi negara tujuan.
            </p>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Output Cards -->
<div class="lg:col-span-6 flex flex-col gap-6">
<div class="bg-primary text-on-primary p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-xl shadow-md relative overflow-hidden">
<div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-4">
<div>
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase text-primary-fixed-dim">Status Peluang Beasiswa</span>
<h3 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-secondary-fixed font-bold mt-1" id="calc-tier-badge">Tinggi: Full / Partial 50%</h3>
</div>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-4xl text-secondary-container">workspace_premium</span>
</div>
<div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 my-6">
<div class="p-3.5 rounded-lg bg-primary-container">
<div class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-primary-fixed-dim">Est. Biaya Kotor / Thn</div>
<div class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm font-bold text-on-primary mt-0.5" id="calc-gross-cost">Rp 510.000.000</div>
</div>
<div class="p-3.5 rounded-lg bg-primary-container">
<div class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-primary-fixed-dim">Potensi Nilai Beasiswa</div>
<div class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm font-bold text-secondary-container mt-0.5" id="calc-scholarship-val">- Rp 255.000.000</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="pt-4 border-t-0 bg-primary-container/40 p-4 rounded-lg">
<div class="flex justify-between items-baseline mb-1">
<span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-primary-fixed-dim">Estimasi Pengeluaran Mandiri (Nett):</span>
<span class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-primary font-bold" id="calc-net-cost">Rp 255.000.000 / thn</span>
</div>
<p class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-primary-container">Sudah mencakup estimasi akomodasi, makan bulanan, asuransi, dan visa tahunan.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="bg-surface-container p-6 rounded-xl">
<h4 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary mb-3 font-bold flex items-center gap-2">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary">checklist</span>
              Rekomendasi Skema Beasiswa yang Cocok
            </h4>
<div class="flex flex-col gap-2.5" id="matched-scholarships-list">
<div class="p-3 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-lowest flex items-center justify-between">
<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary">verified</span>
<div>
<div class="font-label-md text-label-md text-primary">Chevening Scholarship (UK)</div>
<div class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant">Fully Funded · S2 Seluruh Universitas UK</div>
</div>
</div>
<span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-surface-container-high text-primary font-label-sm text-label-sm font-bold">Prioritas 1</span>
</div>
<div class="p-3 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-lowest flex items-center justify-between">
<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary">verified</span>
<div>
<div class="font-label-md text-label-md text-primary">LPDP Reguler &amp; Parsial</div>
<div class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant">Fully Funded / Co-funding · Universitas Top 100</div>
</div>
</div>
<span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-surface-container-high text-primary font-label-sm text-label-sm font-bold">Tinggi</span>
</div>
<div class="p-3 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-lowest flex items-center justify-between">
<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary">school</span>
<div>
<div class="font-label-md text-label-md text-primary">Vice-Chancellor Academic Excellence</div>
<div class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant">Potongan Uang Kuliah 50% Otomatis</div>
</div>
</div>
<span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-secondary-fixed text-on-secondary-fixed font-label-sm text-label-sm font-bold">Mitra Resmi</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- Comprehensive Scholarship Directory -->
<section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12 w-full py-12">
<div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between gap-6 mb-10">
<div>
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-secondary font-bold">Direktori Pendanaan Terbuka</span>
<h2 class="font-headline-xl text-headline-xl text-primary font-bold mt-1">Katalog Beasiswa Unggulan</h2>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mt-2 max-w-2xl">
          Eksplorasi ribuan opsi pendanaan mulai dari beasiswa penuh kementerian, skema bilateral negara tujuan, hingga potongan prestasi akademik universitas.
        </p>
</div>
<!-- Filter Buttons -->
<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2" id="dir-filters">
<button class="px-4 py-2 rounded-full font-label-md text-label-md font-bold bg-primary text-on-primary transition-all" data-filter="all" type="button">Semua Program</button>
<button class="px-4 py-2 rounded-full font-label-md text-label-md font-bold bg-surface-container text-on-surface-variant hover:text-primary transition-all" data-filter="gov-id" type="button">Pemerintah RI</button>
<button class="px-4 py-2 rounded-full font-label-md text-label-md font-bold bg-surface-container text-on-surface-variant hover:text-primary transition-all" data-filter="gov-dest" type="button">Negara Tujuan</button>
<button class="px-4 py-2 rounded-full font-label-md text-label-md font-bold bg-surface-container text-on-surface-variant hover:text-primary transition-all" data-filter="univ-partner" type="button">Mitra Kampus</button>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Cards Grid -->
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6" id="scholarship-cards-grid">
<!-- LPDP -->
<div class="scholarship-card bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between" data-category="gov-id">
<div>
<div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-4">
<span class="px-3 py-1 rounded bg-surface-container-high font-label-sm text-label-sm text-primary font-bold">Pemerintah Indonesia</span>
<span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-secondary-fixed text-on-secondary-fixed font-label-sm text-label-sm font-bold">Fully Funded</span>
</div>
<h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary font-bold">LPDP (Lembaga Pengelola Dana Pendidikan)</h3>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-2">
            Mencakup biaya kuliah 100%, tunjangan bulanan (living allowance), asuransi kesehatan, visa, tunjangan keluarga (S3), serta tiket pesawat pulang-pergi.
          </p>
<div class="my-4 py-3 bg-surface-container-low rounded-lg px-4 flex flex-col gap-1.5 font-body-sm text-body-sm">
<div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-on-surface-variant">Jenjang:</span><span class="font-bold text-primary">Master (S2) &amp; Doktor (S3)</span></div>
<div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-on-surface-variant">Periode Seleksi:</span><span class="font-bold text-primary">Tahap 1 (Jan-Jun) &amp; Tahap 2 (Jun-Nov)</span></div>
<div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-on-surface-variant">Syarat IPK:</span><span class="font-bold text-primary">Min. 3.00 (S2) / 3.25 (S3)</span></div>
</div>
</div>
<a class="w-full py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-surface-container text-primary hover:bg-surface-container-high font-label-md text-label-md font-bold text-center transition-colors" href="#">
          Panduan Kurasi Essay LPDP
        </a>
</div>
<!-- IISMA -->
<div class="scholarship-card bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between" data-category="gov-id">
<div>
<div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-4">
<span class="px-3 py-1 rounded bg-surface-container-high font-label-sm text-label-sm text-primary font-bold">Kemendikbudristek</span>
<span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-secondary-fixed text-on-secondary-fixed font-label-sm text-label-sm font-bold">Fully Funded</span>
</div>
<h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary font-bold">IISMA (Indonesian Int. Student Mobility Awards)</h3>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-2">
            Program beasiswa mobilitas 1 semester bagi mahasiswa aktif S1 &amp; Vokasi Indonesia di 100+ universitas top dunia dengan transfer hingga 20 SKS.
          </p>
<div class="my-4 py-3 bg-surface-container-low rounded-lg px-4 flex flex-col gap-1.5 font-body-sm text-body-sm">
<div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-on-surface-variant">Jenjang:</span><span class="font-bold text-primary">Sarjana Semester 4 - 6</span></div>
<div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-on-surface-variant">Durasi:</span><span class="font-bold text-primary">1 Semester (4-6 Bulan)</span></div>
<div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-on-surface-variant">Bahasa:</span><span class="font-bold text-primary">IELTS 6.0 / TOEFL iBT 78 / Duolingo 100</span></div>
</div>
</div>
<a class="w-full py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-surface-container text-primary hover:bg-surface-container-high font-label-md text-label-md font-bold text-center transition-colors" href="#">
          Bimbingan Seleksi IISMA
        </a>
</div>
<!-- BIM (Beasiswa Indonesia Maju) -->
<div class="scholarship-card bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between" data-category="gov-id">
<div>
<div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-4">
<span class="px-3 py-1 rounded bg-surface-container-high font-label-sm text-label-sm text-primary font-bold">Puspresnas / BPPT</span>
<span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-secondary-fixed text-on-secondary-fixed font-label-sm text-label-sm font-bold">Fully Funded S1/S2</span>
</div>
<h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary font-bold">Beasiswa Indonesia Maju (BIM)</h3>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-2">
            Dikhususkan untuk peserta didik berprestasi di ajang olimpiade sains, riset, seni, maupun olahraga untuk menempuh gelar sarjana di universitas elit dunia.
          </p>
<div class="my-4 py-3 bg-surface-container-low rounded-lg px-4 flex flex-col gap-1.5 font-body-sm text-body-sm">
<div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-on-surface-variant">Jenjang:</span><span class="font-bold text-primary">S1 Luar Negeri (Degree)</span></div>
<div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-on-surface-variant">Target:</span><span class="font-bold text-primary">Siswa SMA/SMK Kelas XII Berprestasi</span></div>
<div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-on-surface-variant">Fasilitas:</span><span class="font-bold text-primary">Full Tuition + Living Allowance + Tiket</span></div>
</div>
</div>
<a class="w-full py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-surface-container text-primary hover:bg-surface-container-high font-label-md text-label-md font-bold text-center transition-colors" href="#">
          Pelatihan Profil Prestasi BIM
        </a>
</div>
<!-- Chevening UK -->
<div class="scholarship-card bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between" data-category="gov-dest">
<div>
<div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-4">
<span class="px-3 py-1 rounded bg-surface-container-high font-label-sm text-label-sm text-primary font-bold">FCDO Inggris Raya</span>
<span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-secondary-fixed text-on-secondary-fixed font-label-sm text-label-sm font-bold">Fully Funded Master</span>
</div>
<h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary font-bold">Chevening Scholarship (UK)</h3>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-2">
            Beasiswa bergengsi kepemimpinan global pemerintah Inggris untuk program Master 1 tahun di universitas mana pun di UK. Menuntut rekam jejak kepemimpinan.
          </p>
<div class="my-4 py-3 bg-surface-container-low rounded-lg px-4 flex flex-col gap-1.5 font-body-sm text-body-sm">
<div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-on-surface-variant">Pengalaman Kerja:</span><span class="font-bold text-primary">Min. 2 Tahun (2.800 Jam)</span></div>
<div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-on-surface-variant">Deadline Tahunan:</span><span class="font-bold text-primary">Awal November Tiap Tahun</span></div>
<div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-on-surface-variant">Komponen:</span><span class="font-bold text-primary">Full Tuition, Tunjangan London/Non-London</span></div>
</div>
</div>
<a class="w-full py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-surface-container text-primary hover:bg-surface-container-high font-label-md text-label-md font-bold text-center transition-colors" href="#">
          Bedah 4 Esai Wajib Chevening
        </a>
</div>
<!-- Australia Awards (AAS) -->
<div class="scholarship-card bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between" data-category="gov-dest">
<div>
<div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-4">
<span class="px-3 py-1 rounded bg-surface-container-high font-label-sm text-label-sm text-primary font-bold">DFAT Australia</span>
<span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-secondary-fixed text-on-secondary-fixed font-label-sm text-label-sm font-bold">Fully Funded</span>
</div>
<h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary font-bold">Australia Awards Scholarships (AAS)</h3>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-2">
            Inisiatif pembangunan bilateral Australia bagi talenta Indonesia untuk gelar Master &amp; Doktor, dilengkapi pelatihan bahasa Pre-Departure Training di Bali/Jakarta.
          </p>
<div class="my-4 py-3 bg-surface-container-low rounded-lg px-4 flex flex-col gap-1.5 font-body-sm text-body-sm">
<div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-on-surface-variant">Syarat IPK:</span><span class="font-bold text-primary">Min. 2.90 (Prioritas DTA lebih fleksibel)</span></div>
<div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-on-surface-variant">Skor Minimum:</span><span class="font-bold text-primary">IELTS 5.5 / TOEFL ITP 525</span></div>
<div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-on-surface-variant">Pemberangkatan:</span><span class="font-bold text-primary">Disertai pelatihan intensif pra-kuliah</span></div>
</div>
</div>
<a class="w-full py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-surface-container text-primary hover:bg-surface-container-high font-label-md text-label-md font-bold text-center transition-colors" href="#">
          Konsultasi Sasaran Wilayah AAS
        </a>
</div>
<!-- Fulbright USA -->
<div class="scholarship-card bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between" data-category="gov-dest">
<div>
<div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-4">
<span class="px-3 py-1 rounded bg-surface-container-high font-label-sm text-label-sm text-primary font-bold">AMINEF / US Dept. of State</span>
<span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-secondary-fixed text-on-secondary-fixed font-label-sm text-label-sm font-bold">Full Fellowship</span>
</div>
<h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary font-bold">Fulbright Master &amp; Doctoral Awards</h3>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-2">
            Skema unggulan belajar di universitas terkemuka Amerika Serikat. Memberikan asistensi penempatan kampus terbaik yang sesuai dengan rancangan riset pelamar.
          </p>
<div class="my-4 py-3 bg-surface-container-low rounded-lg px-4 flex flex-col gap-1.5 font-body-sm text-body-sm">
<div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-on-surface-variant">Batas Lamaran:</span><span class="font-bold text-primary">15 Februari (Setiap Tahun)</span></div>
<div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-on-surface-variant">Kriteria:</span><span class="font-bold text-primary">IPK 3.00, TOEFL ITP 550 / iBT 80</span></div>
<div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-on-surface-variant">Durasi:</span><span class="font-bold text-primary">1-2 Thn (Master) / 3 Thn (Doktor)</span></div>
</div>
</div>
